{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42317","headline":"南都遇前嘉鱼刘令言游闽岭作此与之 · 徐铉","name":"南都遇前嘉鱼刘令言游闽岭作此与之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我持使节经韶石，君作闲游过武夷。\n两地山光成独赏，隔年乡思暗相知。\n洪厓坛上长岑寂，孺子亭前自别离。\n珍重分岐一盃酒，强加餐饭数吟诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}